look material
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('controlCenter',{})['layout']=['nowPlaying:2x2'];json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
setup sh -c 'while :; do pw-play --volume 0.05 /usr/share/sounds/freedesktop/stereo/complete.oga; done' >/dev/null 2>&1 &
wait 2
ipc panels open controlCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
note the Now Playing cast button opens the Cast page (top-right of the card)
ptr move 1660 66 sleep 50 click
wait 0.6
shot cast-page
note row icons TV or speaker
ipc panels close
